<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela, Brazil to sign electricity trade pact.</title>
<headline>Venezuela, Brazil to sign electricity trade pact.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela and Brasil are expected to sign an electricity trade pact on Wednesday January 29, the Venezuelan Ministry of Energy and Mines said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Electricity Interconnection Agreement should allow Venezuela to sell electricity to the northern Brasilian city of Boa Vista, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600</p>
